<h2>Intro</h2>
<p>Palmon: Survival is a monster-catching, base-building, automation, and survival combat mobile game from LILITH TECHNOLOGY HONG KONG LIMITED / Lilith Games. The official store pages describe a creature-collecting survival/crafting game where you capture Palmon, assign them to production jobs, build your camp, fight, gather, and expand. That matters for offerwall players because the paid tasks are usually tied to Camp levels, not just account creation or normal playtime.</p>
