<h2>Expanded Step-by-Step Strategy</h2>
<h3>Step 1: Install and open the game</h3>
<p>Install only through the tracked offer link. Do not manually search the app store unless the platform explicitly tells you to. Screenshot the offer page before installation, including payout, tasks, deadlines, device rules, provider, and any pending period. Finish the tutorial until the game unlocks the Camp upgrade loop.</p>
