<h2>Intro</h2>
<p>Yes, you can play Palmon: Survival without spending money. The harder question is whether you can complete the offerwall ladder without spending. Those are different things. The game itself has free progression systems: idle production, gathering, daily quests, guild gifts, AP usage, events, codes, Palmon work assignments, and check-in rewards. But the GPT/offerwall version adds deadlines, and the upper Camp milestones are timer/resource-gated.</p>
<p>Based on the research and current community evidence, Camp 6, Camp 13, and Camp 16 are realistic no-spend targets. Camp 18-20 can be possible if you are consistent. Camp 22 is a difficult stretch. Camp 24+ is risky. Camp 26-30 should not be treated as realistic no-spend goals for most users.</p>
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Can you complete Palmon: Survival for free? You can complete some milestones for free, but you should not expect to max the offer.</p>
